@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Pre-exam readiness check (Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy, Services/Readiness/ReadinessCheckService,
' DashboardViewModel.RunReadinessAsync / RetryReadinessItemAsync / ReportReadinessAsync /
' ConfirmAttendanceAsync / UpdateStartEligibility, Core/Dashboard/StartGate, ExamsController.SubmitReadiness / OpensAt)
' Simplified labels: thresholds, endpoint and event names are in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}

|Desktop App|
start
:Load exam rules,
press Run check;
repeat
  :Run 7 checks: network,
  clock, screen capture,
  camera*, microphone*,
  secure mode, disk
  (* only if required);
  |Server|
  :Recompute the result,
  save and audit it,
  update live monitor;
  |Desktop App|
repeat while (Passed, or\nnot required?) is ([no: fix,\nRetry]) not ([yes])
if (Checked in?) then ([no])
  :Press
  Check In;
else ([yes])
endif
:Start enabled when the
exam opens (pass valid
for 30 min);
stop
@enduml
